Uses SineStack AI contracts and its shared transport, built on Vercel AI SDK
(Copyright 2023 Vercel, Inc.; Apache-2.0). Provider methods perform single
protocol operations. Waiting, retries and signal composition remain in core.
Meshy's public API reference and OpenAPI specification were used as protocol
references; no Meshy SDK execution engine is embedded.
